{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>李彩華（Rain）近年專注在內地發展，工作不斷的她賺到盤滿缽滿，吸金力驚人，有傳她現時持有12個物業，身家早已超過2億，是圈中名副其實的隱形小富婆！今日（11日）李彩華迎來43歲生日，連日來獲各大品牌簇擁慶祝，日前她於社交平台分享慶生日常，獲頂級奢侈名牌Louis Vuitton（LV）及Hermès在店內包場送上生日驚喜，極顯尊貴身分！</p><figure><img alt=\"隱形小富婆！（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064920501304168448569801.jpeg/Uzr9s1Eip6eVNRdeGtIegA0F8t43J7pvXJRDwFyUQ8A\"/><figcaption>隱形小富婆！（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好Fit！（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154785947280216064528179.jpeg/GjpWEtNg2CsD-5py19rhIXie_yJTiLANxH0bhcR9G4U\"/><figcaption>好Fit！（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感睡衣。（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196869207413755904472568.jpeg/WNS5EBRHoSUzcCq3oE6A2LeEowoUVG-nnh6yrZ4esq0\"/><figcaption>性感睡衣。（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得極好！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196868062331277312873194.jpeg/MSiVkXYOpFvM2DScOcqv4W5EL5CaANN-wWyyDsFssg4\"/><figcaption>Keep得極好！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>李彩華43歲生日連環慶祝　LV特設「HAPPY BIRTHDAY RAIN」佈置</p><p>李彩華在IG限時動態大曬慶生排場，可見LV在店內為她精心佈置了超豪華的慶生角落，現場設有金色氣球花海塔、寫有「HAPPY BIRTHDAY RAIN」的發光英文字母燈飾，以及多隻極具標誌性的LV毛絨公仔。壽星女李彩華身穿紅黑橫間長袖衫配搭超短熱褲、戴上黑超，大騷白滑美腿，少女味滿瀉。李彩華雙手合十許願，抱着鮮花露出一臉燦爛笑容，更獲品牌方送上禮物！</p><figure><img alt=\"李彩華在LV店內慶生。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196868059822952448925067.png/g-SL2sKZCV0zNNIbm-Q__jxUrxC7VZjsMP5IazD-SGs\"/><figcaption>李彩華在LV店內慶生。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"43歲生日。（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196868064634081280501967.jpeg/ZIfjQCqaMPliUNSADkgIntQh2SRcf7ou3tFGwt7RRsI\"/><figcaption>43歲生日。（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感！（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260226/1103750068231868416761920.jpeg/3bAnSuB4wGiVmJ1bEkm1hHk3tWF0L5Bc61LuwutS7sI\"/><figcaption>性感！（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><p>李彩華獲Hermès安排專屬慶生　20萬Mini Jypsiere極搶鏡</p><p>除了獲LV安排慶生活動之外，一向是Hermès超級「忠粉」的李彩華亦獲品牌方安排專屬慶生環節，相中所見，她現身Hermès店內，坐在皮梳化上，手捧生日蛋糕，身旁放着一個價值約20萬的白色鱷魚皮Hermès Mini Jypsiere手袋，品牌方亦送上精緻禮物，足見她作為超級VIP的超然地位！</p><figure><img alt=\"李彩華獲Hermès驚喜慶生。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196868056878419968706235.png/MXvYjJglt2fPcMR5jTq9DcJsbDey3yI-YgY2yGIGNsg\"/><figcaption>李彩華獲Hermès驚喜慶生。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hermès Constance Mini採用珍稀的原色蜥蜴皮。（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260409/1118955645262368768947283.jpeg/0rj5Qz9HMyACK2WsiqaKgKa3Es3gIlvZhSmLPYUpiz0\"/><figcaption>Hermès Constance Mini採用珍稀的原色蜥蜴皮。（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李彩華有不少Hermès手袋。（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260226/1103751776051400704510927.jpeg/oBw56Kbws_rElEh28Pyydzakj_w_bDMbUfkrIFH5KyA\"/><figcaption>李彩華有不少Hermès手袋。（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁！（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260226/1103751418302435328763549.jpeg/QW4CWgU97nUTiO5JsUy9-ZWrPXOXab82skcKULJHClA\"/><figcaption>勁！（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hermès Kelly Lakis。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250312/976531462922964992907432.jpeg/0DgHeLbRMdxy_qdNEKexOH4aXh1jJ9xQOg_WbjoP1m4\"/><figcaption>Hermès Kelly Lakis。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hermès Kelly Doll Picto。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250312/976531464651149312047268.jpeg/RwxWNSg9ohow8GRoinaBDBy3hEffqpk_D7uwsg-7sLI\"/><figcaption>Hermès Kelly Doll Picto。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hermès Constance III Miroir Clouté Bag。（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241101/929090400784748544912607.jpeg/nELbx4uhBbx--KUEzv81uhdXjTKPXbGnAFKxqQBSsak\"/><figcaption>Hermès Constance III Miroir Clouté Bag。（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有「影子包」之稱的Hermès Birkin Shadow Bag。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230830/773621108074090496937452.jpeg/2g5akeUJmQTBila9e1cYEwyc4YNNQcYiPYLguj2C4Lo\"/><figcaption>有「影子包」之稱的Hermès Birkin Shadow Bag。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hermès Kelly Doll Bag。（微博@李彩華Rainli李彩樺）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230830/773630368245878784468027.jpeg/tWvTIn1SRJ9Wenij7RD1Rest_Ja6783f0YjuxtGI7sY\"/><figcaption>Hermès Kelly Doll Bag。（微博@李彩華Rainli李彩樺）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:12:40.623685+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1022,"images":16,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:00:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:48.975687+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:06:14.590194+00:00","content_hash":"2230d59e8dca7e7e96b4ef97dfcee93e9b0ce2a2d1e2816e15882e038e8b9074","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}